    - target: {fileID: 8720089733233688979, guid: aacf23fd940d08d419d1dcbc7feb3a70,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: description
      value: 'The Phong model was introduced by Bui Tuong Phong in 1973. It has 3
        components.

        - Ambient light

        - Diffuse light

        -
        Specular reflections

        Specular reflections are mirror-like reflections.
        They use the color of the light source.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
